WEBVTT

00:06:00.163 --> 00:06:04.204
And then I got to college and started to
redefine my identity around excellence

00:06:04.204 --> 00:06:07.579
in school, which which was something
that then got reinforced.

00:06:07.579 --> 00:06:11.829
And then over time it felt like
every single project I took

00:06:11.829 --> 00:06:14.913
on was was one where I knew I could excel.

00:06:15.246 --> 00:06:18.663
And that way I was just fortifying
my armor more and more.

00:06:19.204 --> 00:06:22.163
And I started to feel like this is
a mistake and I'm missing out

00:06:22.163 --> 00:06:25.954
on opportunities for learning
and for challenging myself

00:06:25.954 --> 00:06:29.579
and stretching myself. And so I just
I'd love to get your reactions on

00:06:29.579 --> 00:06:34.996
on this idea of for those of us who are so
accustomed to to treating excellence